SUMMARY:Doors Open - Tour of New Art Trail Opening this Summer (Commission
 ers St.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: This was previously sold out and I
  spoke to Doors Open and was fortunate to secure 5 additional tickets for 
 members.**\n\nOn **Saturday May 23rd**\, **be part of Doors Open Toronto f
 or a behind-the-scenes experience of public art sites at Biidaasige Park i
 n the New Lassonde Art Trail\, that will open this summer. This is such a 
 wonderful opportunity that we rarely get a chance to experience\, as we ma
 y see art installations being built.** Scheduled to launch in summer 2026\
 , the Lassonde Art Trail (LAT) will be a free\, open-air destination for o
 utstanding contemporary art from around the world. For Doors Open\, join t
 he LAT team to discover the Art Trail sites\, starting at Fire Hall 30 Pla
 za and continuing along the network of paths through Biidaasige Park. Tour
  guests may have the opportunity to see several artworks already in place 
 as well as others partway through installation. This unique\, behind-the-s
 cenes experience introduces visitors to the complexities of creating and i
 nstalling public art and integrating it into an urban park system. Learn a
 bout the hidden support structures that make up the engineering of the Art
  Trail\, the themes and environmental concerns artists are responding to a
 nd the kinds of sculptures planned for the Art Trail’s launch season and
  beyond.\n\nThis is an outdoor event\, so if the forecast calls for rain\,
  will make a call 3 hours prior to the event start time.\n\n**Prepare for 
 the walk:**\n\n* Walking shoes\n* Hat\n* Sunglasses\n* Water\n\nThe remind
 er will let you know the temperature and any other details\n‐‐----‐-
 ---‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**COST:**\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\
 n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n*
  **RSVP Yes to confirm you will show up**\n* Your ticket will be provided 
 at meetup time and location.\n* A reminder will be sent the day before wit
 h my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n* As these tickets
  were difficult to come by\, please be sure about attending.\n* I can offe
 r to drive 4 people from Coxwell subway at 1:15pm\n\nRSVPs close 1 day pri
 or and cancellations may result in a No Show and impact future attendance.
 \n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet at: 1:40pm** **in front of and to the right si
 de of Fire Hall 30 Plaza at 51 Commissioners St.**\n**1:50pm: we will join
  the rest of the tour group**\n**2pm**: Tour starts\n**Tour length: 1.5 ho
 urs**\nAfter: There is a BBQ restaurant down there\, so hope we can grab s
 ome food or drinks\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments in the event aft
 er
